<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 5.8 points to 747.4 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 5.8 points to 747.4 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 5.8 points on Monday to 747.4 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the 10 sectoral indices rose, with the investment fund sector rising the most, up 14.9 points to 1,178.6.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
